@techreport{osti_972902,
	annote = {This book is a revision of "The Effects of Nuclear Weapons" which was issued in 1957.  It was prepared by the Defense Atomic Support Agency of the Department of Defense in coordination with other cognizant governmental agencies and was published by the U.S. Atomc Energy Commission.  Although the complex nature of nuclear weapons effects does not always allow exact evaluation, the conclusions reached herein represent the combined judgment of a number of the most competent scientists working the problem.    There is a need for widespread public understanding of the best information available on the effects of nuclear weapons.  The purpose of this book is to present as accurately as possible, within the limits of national security, a comprehensive summary of this information.},
